<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai wins $115 mln container orders.</title>
<headline>Hyundai wins $115 mln container orders.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hyundai Precision and Industries Co Ltd, a unit of South Korea's Hyundai Group, said on Wednesday it has won refrigerator container orders worth $115 million this month. </p>
<p>A Hyundai statement said the orders for 4,900 refrigerator containers had come from several foreign shipping and leasing firms including Sea Land Services Co Ltd of the United States, Denmark's Maersk Line, and Hong Kong's Florens Leasing Co Ltd. The latter is part of the Florens Group Ltd.</p>
<p>The containers will be delivered by the end of May next year, it said.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
